 ots\, prominences\, and other solar features in real time.\nA short presen
 tation on the Sun will be given at the beginning. This program will be run
  by two PhD students studying astronomy at the University of Toronto. They
 'll be happy to answer your 'burning' questions about the sun and space.\n
 For all ages! Children must be accompanied by a caregiver.\nDrop in\, no r
 egistration required.
