 me to commemorate the abolition of slavery and celebrate the contributions
  of Black Communities.\nIn this workshop with Dr. Isaac Nii Akrong (\nwww.
 isaacniiakrong.com\n)\, participants will learn West African drumming form
 s such as\nkpanlogo\n\,\ndjembe\nand\nsogo\n. Along with learning proper t
 echniques and playing with songs\, everyone will learn about the history o
 f the drums\, how they are made\, and the cultural significance of the mus
 ic.  The rhythmic patterns bring natural joy!\nNo previous experience requ
 ired – all ages and abilities welcome. Drop-in. No registration required
 .
