DESCRIPTION:Take a trip around our solar system without leaving the comfor
 t of planet Earth. Explore the strange landscapes of the inner and outer p
 lanets and their moons. We've even included Pluto! Learn how our understan
 ding of these worlds has evolved since their discovery. In our exhibit you
 'll find original art\, novels\, short stories and more set on these fanta
 stic celestial bodies.\nThis exhibit can be viewed during the Merril Colle
 ction's regular hours. It opens on Tuesday\, May 19 following the holiday 
 weekend.\nDiagram of Saturn's Moons by Frank R. Paul\, 1953.
